  "commit_message": "Parse unbracketed IPv6 ip:port from the server (#1422) (#3307)\n\n* Parse unbracketed IPv6 ip:port from the server (#1422)\n\nCLUSTER NODES, MOVED/ASK and CLIENT LIST write IPv6 addresses without\nbrackets, i.e. \"2a06:4e80:3:a::a:7000\". The RFC 3986 parser used for\nconfiguration strings reads that as a (valid!) eight-group address with\nno port, so cluster nodes ended up as \"[2a06:4e80:3:a::a:7000]:0\" and\nredirections and client addresses were equally wrong.\n\nAdd Format.TryParseServerEndPoint for the ",
